From df2766a50693069a237d03b509cf81b5660aa6b9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xaver Hugl <xaver.hugl@kde.org>
Date: Wed, 22 Oct 2025 19:38:27 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] plugins/screencast: add support for non-sRGB streams

Basically we announce all primaries and transfer functions we support to the
client, the client does the same, and Pipewire picks the intersection.

Upstream-MR: https://invent.kde.org/plasma/kwin/-/merge_requests/8293
Upstream-Commit: 3c1f2b662a6d740933f91461bae992ed7e28d5cd
Target-Version: KWin v6.8.0

